    {
      "text": "墨西哥与日本碰撞诞生的新东京黑帮政权",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Our story takes place in Nuevo-Tokyo, an offspring of chaos that was born when Japan and Mexico collided in fire, power and betrayal. A land where a new feudal regime was forged between Narcos and Yakuzas, forming a new ruling class, The Narkuzas.",
