    },
    {
      "text": "精准移动站位与时机攻击决定连招战",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Precise movement, positioning and perfectly timed attacks decide every fight. It’s a pick-up-and-play brawler that’s deceptively simple, yet deeply rewarding once you start mastering combos and builds.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3764970/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "师父训练与墨日精灵共同塑造流派",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Unlock ninja skills by training with el Mero Mero Sensei. Gain the favor of powerful Mexican-Japanese spirits and unleash their powers throughout your runs. Experiment with different builds, discover devastating combos and carve your own fighting style.",
